Provenance
----------
ipmi-connect was developed independently for interoperability with hardware the author owns.
The protocols were worked out by studying the viewer applets served by the author's own BMCs
and BMC firmware lawfully obtained from the vendors, and by observing the author's own devices,
as permitted by sections 50B and 50BA of the Copyright, Designs and Patents Act 1988. No vendor
source code was accessed. No vendor code, binaries, firmware or documentation are included.

